# Urgent Necropsy's collect evidence X is part of the total cost determined once its targets are chosen (CR 601.2f), and a
# total its caster can't pay makes the cast illegal (CR 601.2h, 701.59a): it is taken back with nothing paid. Bot1's
# graveyard holds two Lightning Bolts (2 in all). Aimed at Haywire Mite (1) and Goblin Bombardment (2), the cast asks 3 and
# is taken back - the Necropsy in hand, the pool untouched. Aimed at the Bombardment alone it asks 2: the Bolts are exiled,
# and only the Bombardment is destroyed.

